sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/Browser
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant GL as GitLab API

    U->>FE: Klickt Arbeitsbereich (z.B. feature/x)
    FE->>BE: GET /workspaces/details?repo=...&branch=...&packageName=...&version=...&resource=...
    BE->>BE: app_token prüfen -> gitlab_access_token auflösen

    BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/tree?path=<basePath>&ref=<branch>&recursive=true&per_page=100
    GL-->>BE: [ {path, type}, ... ]

    BE->>BE: Filtere relevante Dateien (templates, metadata, changelog)

    par Hole Templates (parallel)
        loop für jede *.json unter input/templates/
            BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/files/:urlencodedPath/raw?ref=<branch>
            GL-->>BE: Dateiinhalt (JSON-String)
        end
    and Hole Metadata
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/files/:urlencoded(metaPfad)/raw?ref=<branch>
        GL-->>BE: JSON-String
    and Hole Changelog
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/repository/files/:urlencoded(changelogPfad)/raw?ref=<branch>
        GL-->>BE: JSON- oder Markdown-String
    end

    BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id                             %% Repo + default_branch (optional)
    GL-->>BE: { id, default_branch }
    BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/merge_requests?state=opened&sourceBranch=<branch>&targetBranch=<default_branch>&per_page=1
    GL-->>BE: [ { id, webUrl } ] oder []
    alt MR existiert
        BE->>GL: GET /projects/:id/merge_requests/:id/discussions?per_page=100
        GL-->>BE: [ discussions ... ]
        BE->>BE: Mappe Discussions/Notes -> comments[] (file, line, body, author, createdAt, resolved, threadId)
    else kein MR
        BE->>BE: comments = []
    end

    BE-->>FE: 200 { templates: [...], metadaten_json: "...", changelogs_json: "...", mr: { id, webUrl } | null, comments: [ ... ] }
FE-->>U: Ansicht rendern (Inhalte + Kommentar-Panel)
